        <Id>k__BackingField: d52f67b2-3ee2-4962-b198-0bf695721b20
        <Pos>k__BackingField: {x: 18576, y: 20409}
        <Title>k__BackingField: <p>Intro Encounter</p>
        <RawContent>k__BackingField: <pre><code>if sword_locked</code></pre><p>I
          see your blade is untested. Allow me to teach you its secrets and refine
          your skill. It will cost you 50 Gold.</p><pre><code>elseif !sword_locked</code></pre><p>Ah,
          a seasoned fighter! How many tales does your blade whisper from its edge?</p><pre><code>endif</code></pre><p></p>
        <RuntimeContent>k__BackingField: 
        <ColorTheme>k__BackingField: cyan
        <Components>k__BackingField:
